From: JoshuaHayesWasHere <josh.hayes121@icloud.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 23:30:46 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] fix(web): a jstack home's group lists only its open rows, and
 what merged leaves the tree

A home with no live work is one line with nothing to unfold: the rows it merged in the last
48 hours are no longer listed under it. The root's "N merged" count since its last visit stays.
The server reads no brief for a merged slug, and a landed merge no longer names its home.
